    "description": "Tranquil and timeless, this elegantly-designed penthouse feels on top of the world, with windows framing breathtaking views of San Francisco's downtown skyline to the rolling hills below Sutro Tower. This 4-bedroom, 2-bath, house-like condo offers a light-filled interior where modern and period details blend seamlessly, creating a sophisticated, yet comfortable living space. The high ceilings and thoughtful layout provide an airy feel, while cleverly designed storage spaces ensure functionality. From the great room, step onto the west-facing deck to enjoy sunshine and stunning views. Highlights include abundant private storage, a magical shared garden, EV charger, solar panels and more. Located in prime Bernal Heights, this home lies in a quaint tree-lined cul-de-sac with a close-knit community taking pride in the shared outdoor spaces. For the explorers, you have nature at your doorstep with 3 nearby parks, while still being close to the cultural and nightlife scene of downtown. Head over to Cortland, where you'll find art spaces and boutiques, eateries, wine bars, and more. Whether you're grabbing a coffee at a cozy caf or picking up fresh produce, Bernal Heights offers a vibrant neighborhood with something for everyone."
  },
